  "description": "Pulling No Punches is a satirical game in the 2D beat'em up style with classic arcade influences and modern visuals.\n\nThe game follows the fictional story of a global pandemic that engulfed the world and is being ignored by fanatics who do not believe that the disease is real. It is up to the main characters, 4 common citizens adequately protected with gloves and masks, to deal with these fanatics and solve the situation with the force of their own fists.\n\n \n\n● 4 Co-op Local Multiplayer!\n● 4 Characters with unique Unlockables and Moves!\n● Use everything at your disposal to destroy your enemies: a wide variety of punches, kicks, grabs and headbutts!\n● Handmade art painfully animated frame by frame!",
  "description_short": "A classic 2D arcade action game animated frame by frame. Survive a fictional pandemic in a city filled with madness and denial.",
